Third-party assets
==================

Material textures in textures/ (and source/textures/), loaded by source/src/look.js
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
From Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com), licensed CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication,
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). No attribution is required; the authors are credited here anyway.
Each was downloaded at 2K and repacked at 1024x1024: N_name_alb.jpg is the diffuse (albedo) map, N_name_nh.jpg holds
the OpenGL normal map in RG and the displacement (height, stretched to the full range) in B.

- seaside_rock (Seaside Rock) by Dimitrios Savva: https://polyhaven.com/a/seaside_rock
- rock_face_03 (Rock Face 03) by Dario Barresi, Rico Cilliers: https://polyhaven.com/a/rock_face_03
- rock_pitted_mossy (Rock Pitted Mossy) by Dimitrios Savva, Rico Cilliers: https://polyhaven.com/a/rock_pitted_mossy
- tiger_rock (Tiger Rock) by Dario Barresi: https://polyhaven.com/a/tiger_rock
- rock_boulder_cracked (Rock Boulder Cracked) by Dario Barresi, Dimitrios Savva: https://polyhaven.com/a/rock_boulder_cracked
- sand_03 (Sand 03) by Charlotte Baglioni: https://polyhaven.com/a/sand_03
- coral_ground_02 (Coral Ground 02) by Rob Tuytel: https://polyhaven.com/a/coral_ground_02
- coral_gravel (Coral Gravel) by Rob Tuytel: https://polyhaven.com/a/coral_gravel

